---
const faqs = [
  { q: "What is EcoRouter?", a: "An open source TypeScript SDK that lets an agent buy capabilities like web search over x402, pay in USDC on Stellar, and stay inside a budget enforced by its own Soroban smart account." },
  { q: "Why does it run on Stellar?", a: "Soroban smart accounts can run custom authorization in __check_auth, so the spending rules sit in the agent's account itself. USDC is native on Stellar and settlement is fast and cheap enough to pay per request." },
  { q: "What stops an agent from overspending?", a: "Two layers. The SDK rejects any quote above maxSpendUsdc before paying, and the Soroban account rejects any transfer above max_payment, past total_limit, after expires_at or once revoked." },
  { q: "How is a provider chosen?", a: "Every eligible quote gets an economic cost of price divided by qualityScore times successRate. The lowest cost wins, then the lower price, then the provider id. No model is asked to decide." },
  { q: "Is there a hosted server or custody?", a: "No. The SDK runs in your process, your session secret never leaves it, and funds stay in the Soroban account you own and can withdraw from at any time." },
  { q: "Which network does it support today?", a: "Stellar testnet with USDC. Challenges for any other network or asset are rejected as invalid." },
];
---

<section id="faq" class="bg-surface-soft border-t border-line">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="rails px-5 sm:px-10 py-16 md:py-24 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[0.8fr_1.2fr] gap-10">
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <div class="eyebrow">04 · FAQ</div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-[40px] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] text-ink">Questions</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white card divide-y divide-line-strong">
        {faqs.map((item) => (
          <details class="group px-5 sm:px-6">
            <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none select-none py-5 text-[15px] font-medium text-ink gap-4">
              <span class="leading-snug">{item.q}</span>
              <span class="shrink-0 w-6 h-6 flex items-center justify-center border border-ink text-ink transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-45" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg class="w-3 h-3" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" /></svg>
              </span>
            </summary>
            <p class="pb-5 -mt-1 text-sm text-ink-secondary leading-relaxed pr-8">{item.a}</p>
          </details>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
